<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100157" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεξομοι-όω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>assimilate, make similar</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί τινι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.1054b
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἤθη</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				97a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτῇ τὸ σπέρμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					<u>UP</u>
					14.7
				</span></i>
			; <i>suit, accommodate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ . . σχῆμα τοῖς λόγοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Herm.
					<u>in Phdr.</u>
					p.76
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to become</i> or <i>be like</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				1.9.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				173
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				31.18.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Placit.</u>
				1.6.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακίᾳ καὶ φθόνῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Vett.Val.
					304.27
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συνεξομοιοῦται τὰ τρεφόμενα ταῖς
					τρεφούσαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sor.
					1.88
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῷ περιέχοντι συνεξομοιοῦσθαι</span>
			<i>become assimilated</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				4.21.1
			</span></i>.</div>
